        <div class="page-wrap">
            <section class="welcome-banner"><div><span class="eyebrow"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">psychology</span>Layanan Bimbingan &amp; Konseling Terpadu</span><h1>Selamat Datang, Ibu Siti Rahayu,<br>M.Pd.</h1><p>Ringkasan aktivitas pendampingan, kedisiplinan, dan layanan<br class="desktop-only"> perkembangan siswa SMA Mardisiswa secara komprehensif hari ini.</p></div><div class="banner-actions"><button class="primary-action"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">add_circle</span>+ Konseling Baru</button><button class="light-action"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">warning</span>+ Catat Pelanggaran Cepat</button><button class="soft-action"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">download</span>Ekspor Laporan</button></div><small class="banner-date">Kamis, 24 Oktober 2024</small></section>

