            <div class="content-grid"><div class="content-column"><section class="panel attendance-panel"><div class="panel-title"><div><h2><span class="material-symbols-outlined">insert_chart</span> Tren Kehadiran &amp; Kedisiplinan Siswa</h2><p>Analisis keterlambatan &amp; kehadiran kumulatif 4 pekan Oktober 2024</p></div><div class="period-toggle"><button class="selected">Bulan<br>Ini</button><button>Semester<br>1</button></div></div><div class="attendance-summary"><div><small>RATA-RATA HADIR TEPAT WAKTU</small><strong>96.8% <em>↑ +0.4%</em></strong></div><div><small>TOTAL KETERLAMBATAN</small><strong class="dark">28 <em>Insiden</em></strong></div><div><small>TOTAL ALPHA / TANPA KET.</small><strong class="red-text">6 <em>Hari</em></strong></div></div><div class="legend"><span>Minggu Evaluasi</span><span><i class="dot teal-dot"></i>Tepat Waktu (&gt;95%)</span><span><i class="dot amber-dot"></i>Terlambat</span><span><i class="dot red-dot"></i>Alpha</span></div><div class="bars"><div><label>Pekan 1 (1 - 6 Okt)<b>97.2% Tepat Waktu | 8 Terlambat | 1 Alpha</b></label><div class="bar"><i style="width:93%"></i><b style="width:5%"></b><em style="width:2%"></em></div></div><div><label>Pekan 2 (7 - 13 Okt)<b>96.0% Tepat Waktu | 11 Terlambat | 3 Alpha</b></label><div class="bar"><i style="width:89%"></i><b style="width:7%"></b><em style="width:3%"></em></div></div><div><label>Pekan 3 (14 - 20 Okt)<b>98.1% Tepat Waktu | 5 Terlambat | 1 Alpha</b></label><div class="bar"><i style="width:95%"></i><b style="width:3%"></b><em style="width:2%"></em></div></div><div><label>Pekan 4 (21 - 24 Okt - Berjalan)<b>96.5% Tepat Waktu | 4 Terlambat | 1 Alpha</b></label><div class="bar"><i style="width:92%"></i><b style="width:5%"></b><em style="width:2%"></em></div></div></div><div class="class-summary"><span>Kelas X (Fase E) <b>98.2% Hadir</b></span><span>Kelas XI (Fase F) <b>96.4% Hadir</b></span><span>Kelas XII <b>95.8% Hadir</b></span></div></section>

<section class="panel attention-panel"><div class="panel-title"><div><h2><span class="material-symbols-outlined red-text">notifications_active</span> Perhatian Khusus Siswa</h2><p>Daftar siswa dengan akumulasi poin catatan perilaku mendekati ambang konseling intensif</p></div><a href="#">Lihat Semua<br>Siswa <span class="material-symbols-outlined">arrow_forward</span></a></div><div class="student-table"><div class="table-head"><span>NO</span><span>SISWA &amp; KELAS</span><span>AKUMULASI<br>POIN</span><span>FOKUS<br>CATATAN</span><span>STATUS<br>TINDAKAN</span><span></span></div>@foreach ([['DA','Dimas Arya Pratama','NISN: 00871293','Kelas XI IPS 2','75','Keterlambatan Berulang (≥6x)','Panggilan Ortu'],['FK','Fajar Kurniawan','NISN: 00654210','Kelas XII MIPA 3','60','Ketidakhadiran Tanpa Izin (3x)','Bimbingan Wali Kelas'],['SM','Sarah Melani','NISN: 00812904','Kelas X-4','50','Kendala Kehadiran & Adaptasi','Rencana Home Visit'],['RA','Rafi Alamsyah','NISN: 00723819','Kelas XI MIPA 1','45','Atribut & Kerapian Seragam','Konseling Tahap 1'],['BP','Bagus Pangestu','NISN: 00892011','Kelas X-2','40','Keterlambatan Pagi (4x)','Teguran Lisan']] as $i => $s)<div class="table-row"><span>{{ $i + 1 }}</span><span class="student-name"><i class="initial initial-{{ $i }}">{{ $s[0] }}</i><span><strong>{{ $s[1] }}</strong><small>{{ $s[2] }} · {{ $s[3] }}</small></span></span><span class="points p-{{ $i }}">{{ $s[4] }}<small>Poin</small></span><span>{{ $s[5] }}</span><span class="status status-{{ $i }}">{{ $s[6] }}</span><button aria-label="Lihat siswa"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">person</span></button></div>@endforeach</div><div class="threshold"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">info</span>Ambang batas pemanggilan orang tua diatur pada akumulasi 75 poin pelanggaran.<a href="#">Atur Regulasi<br>Poin</a></div></section></div>

